    "packages/queue/tests/E2E/KedaTest.php": "deploys the worker image to a Kubernetes cluster and lets KEDA scale Jobs from the queue depth: infrastructure, not library behaviour; the run-to-completion drain those Jobs run is ported (KubernetesJobAdapterTest.json) and the depth they scale on is ported (RedisQueueSizeTest.json, ServerTelemetryTest.json)",
    "packages/queue/tests/E2E/WorkermanTest.php": "drives the Workerman process supervisor (Adapter\\Workerman, waived as PHP runtime plumbing); the publish, events, aliases and retry assertions it shares with every worker test are ported in E2EPoolTest.json, SwooleTest.json and NatsServerTest.json",
    "packages/queue/tests/E2E/ShutdownTest.php": "asserts the Swoole supervisor SIGKILLs a forked worker that ignores SIGTERM past shutdownTimeout: process supervision (Adapter\\Swoole::start/stop, waived); Rust workers are tokio tasks stopped through adapter::Stopper, whose draining is ported in E2EPrefetchTest.json",
    "packages/queue/tests/E2E/SwooleRestartTest.php": "asserts the Swoole supervisor re-forks worker processes that exit: process supervision (Adapter\\Swoole::start, waived); the drain-on-stop assertion is ported in E2EPrefetchTest.json (shutdown returns work that never started)"
  },
